    {
      "source": "Force the creation of a session causing the session id to be sent when\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a> is called.",
      "translation": "强制创建会话，以便在调用 <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a> 时发送会话 ID。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "completion notification (success or error)",
      "translation": "完成通知（成功或错误）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This is intended for use with the\n<a href=\"MockServerWebExchange.Builder.html#session(org.springframework.web.server.WebSession)\"><code>session(WebSession)</code></a>\nmethod of the <code>MockServerWebExchange</code> builder, eliminating the need\nto use <code>WebSessionManager</code> or <code>WebSessionStore</code> altogether.",
      "translation": "此方法旨在配合`MockServerWebExchange` 构建器的<a href=\"MockServerWebExchange.Builder.html#session(org.springframework.web.server.WebSession)\"><code>session(WebSession)</code></a>方法使用，从而完全无需使用<code>WebSessionManager</code>或<code>WebSessionStore</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically expiration checks should be automatically made when a session\nis accessed, a new <code>WebSession</code> instance created if necessary, at\nthe start of request processing so that applications don't have to worry\nabout expired session by default.",
      "translation": "通常，在访问会话时会自动进行过期检查；如果必要，则在请求处理开始时创建新的 `<code>WebSession`</code> 实例，从而默认情况下应用程序无需担心会话过期问题。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that this method is not intended for direct use by applications.\nInstead it is automatically invoked just before the response is\ncommitted.",
      "translation": "注意，此方法并非设计供应用程序直接使用。相反，它会在响应提交之前自动调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether a session with the client has been started explicitly via\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a> or implicitly by adding session attributes.\nIf \"false\" then the session id is not sent to the client and the\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a> method is essentially a no-op.",
      "translation": "无论是否已通过 <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a> 显式启动与客户端的会话，还是通过添加会话属性隐式启动。如果为 \"false\"，则不会将会话 ID 发送给客户端，且 <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a> 方法实际上是一个空操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the last time of session access as a result of user activity such\nas an HTTP request. Together with <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getMaxIdleTime()\"><code>maxIdleTimeInSeconds</code></a> this helps to determine when a session is\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#isExpired()\"><code>expired</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将上次会话访问时间作为用户活动（如 HTTP 请求）的结果返回。结合 <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getMaxIdleTime()\"><code>maxIdleTimeInSeconds</code></a>，这有助于确定会话何时已<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#isExpired()\"><code>expired</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <code>true</code> if the session expired after <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getMaxIdleTime()\"><code>maxIdleTime</code></a> elapsed.",
      "translation": "如果会话在 `<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getMaxIdleTime()\"><code>maxIdleTime</code></a>` 超时后过期，则返回 <code>true</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
