    {
      "source": "Return the maximum time after the <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a> before a session expires.",
      "translation": "返回在 `<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a>` 之后会话过期前的最大时间。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether a session with the client has been started explicitly via\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a> or implicitly by adding session attributes.",
      "translation": "客户端会话是否已通过 <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a> 显式启动，或通过添加会话属性隐式启动。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the max amount of time that may elapse after the\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a> before a session is considered\nexpired.",
      "translation": "配置在 `<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a>` 之后允许经过的最大时间量，在此之后会话将被视为已过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Generate a new id for the session and update the underlying session\nstorage to reflect the new id. After a successful call <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getId()\"><code>WebSession.getId()</code></a>\nreflects the new session id.",
      "translation": "生成新会话 ID 并更新底层会话存储以反映该新 ID。在成功调用后，<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getId()\"><code>WebSession.getId()</code></a> 将反映新的会话 ID。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the max amount of time that may elapse after the\n<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a> before a session is considered\nexpired. A negative value indicates the session should not expire.",
      "translation": "配置在 `<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a>` 之后允许经过的最大时间，在此之后会话将被视为已过期。负值表示会话不应过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the maximum time after the <a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a> before a session expires. A negative time indicates the\nsession doesn't expire.",
      "translation": "返回在 `<a href=\"../../../web/server/WebSession.html#getLastAccessTime()\"><code>lastAccessTime</code></a>` 之后会话过期前的最大时间。负数表示会话不会过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
